            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> In visual mode, surround keymaps have delays that cannot, at least as documented, be set to be longer.\r\n\r\nCould you please elaborate on what you mean by \"keymaps do not follow `timeoutlen`\"? Preferably with a keypress-by-keypress explanation of what happens and what you'd expect.\r\n\r\nAnd please share the full config of 'mini.surround', just in case.",
            "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In visual mode, surround keymaps have delays that cannot, at least as documented, be set to be longer.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Could you please elaborate on what you mean by \"keymaps do not follow <code class=\"notranslate\">timeoutlen</code>\"? Preferably with a keypress-by-keypress explanation of what happens and what you'd expect.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">And please share the full config of 'mini.surround', just in case.</p>",
            "bodyText": "In visual mode, surround keymaps have delays that cannot, at least as documented, be set to be longer.\n\nCould you please elaborate on what you mean by \"keymaps do not follow timeoutlen\"? Preferably with a keypress-by-keypress explanation of what happens and what you'd expect.\nAnd please share the full config of 'mini.surround', just in case.",
