                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "This message is [purely informational and can be turned off by setting `config.silent = true`](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/4ca988557786c9a4e41d5e5b6e31b4c9d7379f53/doc/mini-surround.txt#L532-L535). But even after the message is shown, It is still possible to press a surrounding identifier for surrounding to take effect.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This message is <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/4ca988557786c9a4e41d5e5b6e31b4c9d7379f53/doc/mini-surround.txt#L532-L535\">purely informational and can be turned off by setting <code class=\"notranslate\">config.silent = true</code></a>. But even after the message is shown, It is still possible to press a surrounding identifier for surrounding to take effect.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "This message is purely informational and can be turned off by setting config.silent = true. But even after the message is shown, It is still possible to press a surrounding identifier for surrounding to take effect.",
